 update.</p><b data-v-b4c14f53>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-b4c14f53>→</span></b></a><a href="/library/articles/ai-agent-experience/" class="article-card" data-v-7f63aeac data-v-b4c14f53><!----><div class="article-card__meta" data-v-b4c14f53><span data-v-b4c14f53>AI operations</span><span data-v-b4c14f53>6 min read</span></div><h3 data-v-b4c14f53>Agent experience: the missing layer in AI agent orchestration</h3><p data-v-b4c14f53>Turn a vague review request into an assignment an agent can carry out. See how exact inputs, authority, evidence, recovery, and a stopping rule fit together.</p><b data-v-b4c14f53>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-b4c14f53>→</span></b></a><!--]--></div></section></div></article><!--]--></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-e230b581 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a href="/" class="footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a href="/#why" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a href="/#security" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-5f58f905>Download</a><a href="https://github.com/flowmonkeyio/StackOS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-5f58f905>GitHub ↗</a></div></div><div class="site-foo